### Test Flight Ticket PDF Download

@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@bookingId = 1

### 1. Get Ticket Details (JSON)
GET http://localhost:5002/api/booking/{{bookingId}}/ticket
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. Download PDF Ticket
GET http://localhost:5002/api/booking/{{bookingId}}/download-ticket
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. Via API Gateway - Get Ticket Details
GET http://localhost:5000/bookings/{{bookingId}}/ticket
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Via API Gateway - Download PDF Ticket
GET http://localhost:5000/bookings/{{bookingId}}/download-ticket
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
